  FAIL  no arm produces markedly more degenerate Grad-CAM maps   em has 78 of 1500, median over the arms 32
        hit and mass are the numbers the training run already writes. They
        are not point AUC and they are not comparable with row a), because
        their chance level moves with the box area. The point AUC row for
        Grad-CAM needs the maps themselves and therefore a rerun:
          python rsna\befunde\rsna_cam_power.py --arms p5ref p5head_ex p5head_em
        Until then the middle row of the three map table is missing and the
        comparison emergent against trained rests on hit and mass alone.

